<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Accenture Assessment Readiness Plan</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --ink: #101720;
    --ink-soft: #3a4552;
    --paper: #F6F5F1;
    --paper-raised: #FFFFFF;
    --line: #DAD6CB;
    --amber: #C9821E;
    --amber-soft: #F3E4CB;
    --amber-deep: #8f5c14;
    --teal: #2E5C58;
    --teal-soft: #DCE9E7;
    --teal-deep: #1c3d3a;
    --red: #A13D2B;
    --red-soft: #F1DCD5;
    --font-display: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
    --font-body: 'Public Sans', -apple-system, sans-serif;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px);
    padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
      --ink: #EDEAE1; --ink-soft: #B9B3A4; --paper: #12181C; --paper-raised: #1A2126;
      --line: #2C3439; --amber: #E0A245; --amber-soft: #33291a; --amber-deep: #f0bb70;
      --teal: #7FBBB3; --teal-soft: #1c2b29; --teal-deep: #a9d9d1; --red: #E08267; --red-soft: #3a2420;
    }
  }
  :root[data-theme="dark"] {
    --ink: #EDEAE1; --ink-soft: #B9B3A4; --paper: #12181C; --paper-raised: #1A2126;
    --line: #2C3439; --amber: #E0A245; --amber-soft: #33291a; --amber-deep: #f0bb70;
    --teal: #7FBBB3; --teal-soft: #1c2b29; --teal-deep: #a9d9d1; --red: #E08267; --red-soft: #3a2420;
  }
  html { scroll-padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px); }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--font-body); line-height: 1.5; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  .wrap { max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 22px 90px; }

  header.hero { margin-bottom: 34px; }
  .kicker { font-size: 13px; color: var(--teal); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.02em; margin: 0 0 10px; }
  h1 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(30px, 5.5vw, 46px); line-height: 1.08; margin: 0 0 14px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .sub { font-size: 16px; color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 64ch; margin: 0 0 22px; }

  .countdown-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; align-items: stretch; }
  .countdown-card { background: var(--paper-raised); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px 20px; flex: 1 1 200px; }
  .countdown-card .num { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 40px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--amber); line-height: 1; }
  .countdown-card .lbl { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top: 6px; }
  .target-picker { background: var(--paper-raised); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px 20px; flex: 2 1 320px; }
  .target-picker .lbl { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .target-btns { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .tbtn { border: 1px solid var(--line); background: transparent; color: var(--ink); padding: 7px 13px; border-radius: 999px; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 13.5px; cursor: pointer; }
  .tbtn.active { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); border-color: var(--ink); }

  nav.tabs { display: flex; gap: 4px; overflow-x: auto; margin: 34px 0 26px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
  nav.tabs button { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink-soft); background: none; border: none; padding: 10px 14px; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; margin-bottom: -1px; }
  nav.tabs button.active { color: var(--ink); border-bottom-color: var(--amber); }

  .panel { display: none; }
  .panel.active { display: block; animation: fade .25s ease; }
  @keyframes fade { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px);} to {opacity:1; transform:none;} }

  .day-head { display:flex; align-items:baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap;}
  .day-head h2 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 26px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0; }
  .day-date { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .day-objective { font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 4px 0 22px; max-width: 64ch;}

  .progress-track { height: 6px; background: var(--line); border-radius: 999px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 26px; }
  .progress-fill { height: 100%; background: var(--teal); width: 0%; transition: width .3s ease; }

  .block { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--paper-raised); padding: 18px 20px 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .block-title { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .badge { flex-shrink: 0; width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: var(--paper-raised); background: var(--teal); }
  .badge.amber { background: var(--amber); }
  .badge.red { background: var(--red); }
  .block h3 { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin: 0; }
  .block .block-meta { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 4px 0 14px 46px; }

  .subgroup-label { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--teal); letter-spacing: 0.03em; margin: 16px 0 6px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px dashed var(--line); }
  .subgroup-label:first-of-type { border-top: none; padding-top: 0; margin-top: 4px; }

  ul.checklist { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  ul.checklist li { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; padding: 5px 0; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 3px; }
  ul.checklist li:hover { background: var(--paper); }
  .tri { margin-top: 3px; width: 15px; height: 15px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); flex-shrink: 0; transition: background .12s ease, border-color .12s ease; }
  .tri[data-state="red"] { background: var(--red); border-color: var(--red); }
  .tri[data-state="yellow"] { background: var(--amber); border-color: var(--amber); }
  .tri[data-state="green"] { background: var(--teal); border-color: var(--teal); }
  ul.checklist label { cursor: pointer; }
  ul.checklist li.done label { color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .tri-legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 14px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin: -14px 0 20px; }
  .tri-legend .lg { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .tri-legend .dot { width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 3px; display: inline-block; }
  .tri-legend .hint { font-style: italic; }

  .note { border-left: 3px solid var(--amber); background: var(--amber-soft); padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; font-size: 13.5px; margin: 16px 0; }
  .note strong { color: var(--red); }

  /* Timeline / time-strategy bar */
  .timeline-bar { display: flex; width: 100%; height: 34px; border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; margin: 16px 0 10px; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .timeline-seg { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; }
  .timeline-legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .timeline-legend span.dot { display: inline-block; width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 2px; margin-right: 6px; vertical-align: middle; }
  .time-strategy { display: grid; gap: 8px; margin: 14px 0 4px; }
  .time-strategy .row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; font-size: 13.5px; padding: 8px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .time-strategy .row:first-child { border-top: none; }
  .time-strategy .row .t { color: var(--ink-soft); flex-shrink: 0; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 600; }

  /* Priority bars */
  .priority-bars { margin: 14px 0 4px; }
  .pbar-row { margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .pbar-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 13.5px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .pbar-top .pname { font-weight: 600; }
  .pbar-top .pval { color: var(--ink-soft); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .pbar-track { height: 9px; background: var(--line); border-radius: 999px; overflow: hidden; }
  .pbar-fill { height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--teal), var(--amber)); border-radius: 999px; }

  /* Stage flow */
  .stage-flow { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; margin: 16px 0 4px; }
  .stage { border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--paper-raised); border-radius: 4px; padding: 12px 16px; font-size: 13.5px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; align-items: baseline; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .stage .name { font-weight: 700; }
  .stage .dur { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .arrow { text-align: center; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 12.5px; padding: 3px 0; }

  .pillbox { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 10px; }
  .pill { background: var(--teal-soft); color: var(--teal-deep); font-size: 12.5px; padding: 5px 11px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; }

  /* OSI stack diagram */
  .osi-stack { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; margin: 16px 0 8px; }
  .osi-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 30px 1fr 1.3fr; gap: 10px; align-items: center; padding: 9px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 13px; }
  .osi-row .n { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; }
  .osi-row .name { font-weight: 700; }
  .osi-row .ex { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 12px; }
  .osi-row:nth-child(odd) { background: var(--teal-soft); }
  .osi-row:nth-child(even) { background: var(--amber-soft); }

  /* TCP vs UDP comparison */
  .compare-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 0; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; margin: 16px 0 8px; font-size: 13px; }
  .compare-grid > div { padding: 9px 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .compare-grid > div:nth-child(-n+3) { border-top: none; }
  .compare-grid > div:nth-child(3n+1) { border-left: none; background: var(--paper); font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 12px; }
  .compare-grid .h { font-weight: 700; background: var(--ink) !important; color: var(--paper) !important; }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .compare-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .compare-grid > div:nth-child(3n+1) { border-left: none; }
    .compare-grid > div { border-left: none !important; }
  }

  /* Request flow */
  .flow-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin: 16px 0 8px; }
  .flow-pill { background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 14px; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; }
  .flow-chevron { color: var(--amber); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }

  /* Cloud responsibility grid */
  .resp-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 0; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; margin: 16px 0 8px; font-size: 12.5px; }
  .resp-grid > div { padding: 8px 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-left: 1px solid var(--line); text-align: center; }
  .resp-grid > div:nth-child(-n+4) { border-top: none; font-weight: 700; background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); }
  .resp-grid > div:nth-child(4n+1) { border-left: none; text-align: left; font-weight: 600; }
  .resp-grid .you { background: var(--amber-soft); color: var(--amber-deep); font-weight: 600; }
  .resp-grid .them { background: var(--teal-soft); color: var(--teal-deep); font-weight: 600; }
  .resp-legend { display: flex; gap: 16px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom: 4px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .resp-legend .dot { display: inline-block; width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 2px; margin-right: 5px; vertical-align: middle; }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .resp-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } .resp-grid > div:nth-child(-n+4){ display:none; } .resp-grid > div:nth-child(4n+1){ grid-column: 1 / -1; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); font-weight:700; border-left:none; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); } }

  /* Attack cards */
  .attack-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 10px; margin: 16px 0 8px; }
  .attack-card { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 14px; background: var(--paper); }
  .attack-card .aname { font-weight: 700; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--red); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .attack-card .adef { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .attack-card .adef b { color: var(--teal-deep); font-weight: 600; }

  table.priority { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; }
  .grid2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .grid2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  footer.foot { margin-top: 50px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .evidence-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr 1fr; gap:10px; margin-top:14px; }
  .evidence-card { border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:6px; padding:12px 14px; background:var(--paper); }
  .evidence-card .ev-title { font-weight:700; font-size:13px; margin-bottom:4px; }
  .evidence-card .ev-body { font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); }
  .ev-confirmed { border-top:3px solid var(--teal); }
  .ev-reported { border-top:3px solid var(--amber); }
  .ev-variant { border-top:3px solid var(--red); }
  .micro-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:10px; margin:12px 0; }
  .micro-card { border:1px dashed var(--line); border-radius:5px; padding:10px 12px; background:var(--paper); }
  .micro-card strong { display:block; font-size:12.5px; margin-bottom:3px; }
  .micro-card span { font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-soft); }
  .source-strip { font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-top:12px; padding-top:10px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); }
  @media (max-width:640px){ .evidence-grid,.micro-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <header class="hero">
    <p class="kicker">Personal prep plan — built from the official Accenture assessment structure</p>
    <h1>Assessment Readiness Plan</h1>
    <p class="sub">Organized round-by-round, matching how Accenture's process actually works: you only sit the next round after clearing the one before it. Prep each round's tab before you expect to face it, in whatever order your invite runs them — plus a flexible Revision reference for the morning of, or the minutes before, any specific round.</p>

    <div class="countdown-row">
      <div class="countdown-card">
        <div class="num" id="daysLeft">–</div>
        <div class="lbl">days of prep left (today counts)</div>
      </div>
      <div class="target-picker">
        <div class="lbl">Your slot is likely one of these — tap the one you're assigned so the plan tracks it:</div>
        <div class="target-btns" id="targetBtns">
          <button class="tbtn" data-date="2026-09-28">Mon 28 Sept</button>
          <button class="tbtn" data-date="2026-09-29">Tue 29 Sept</button>
          <button class="tbtn" data-date="2026-09-30">Wed 30 Sept</button>
          <button class="tbtn" data-date="2026-10-01">Thu 1 Oct</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="note" id="slotNote">
      Study Round 1 through Round 4 in order over the next few days — by the time your slot arrives you'll have gone through every topic once. There's no separate mock/consolidation day — instead, use the <strong>Revision</strong> tab as a standing reference: skim it the morning of your assessment, or jump to just the one round that's coming up next while you're sitting there, since you'll only advance to it after clearing the previous one anyway.
    </div>
  </header>

  <nav class="tabs" id="tabs">
    <button data-panel="overview" class="active">Overview</button>
    <button data-panel="day1">Round 1 · Technical</button>
    <button data-panel="day2">Round 2 · Coding</button>
    <button data-panel="day3">Round 3 · Behavioral+Cognitive</button>
    <button data-panel="day4">Round 4 · Communication</button>
    <button data-panel="day5">Revision</button>
  </nav>

  <!-- OVERVIEW -->
  <section class="panel active" id="overview">
    <div class="block">
      <div class="block-title"><div class="badge">01</div><h3>How the real assessment is structured</h3></div>
      <div class="block-meta">Straight from your Accenture invite — this is what each day's prep is aimed at</div>
      <div class="stage-flow">
        <div class="stage"><span class="name">Mock assessment</span><span class="dur">10 min · mandatory tech check</span></div>
        <div class="arrow">↓</div>
        <div class="stage"><span class="name">1 · Technical</span><span class="dur">45 min — MS Office &amp; common apps, pseudocode, networking/security/cloud fundamentals, basic programming concepts</span></div>
        <div class="arrow">↓ sectional cutoff ↓</div>
        <div class="stage"><span class="name">2 · Coding</span><span class="dur">60 min · 3 questions — reported mix: 1 DSA (Java/Python/C#) + 1 SQL join query + 1 HTML/CSS/JS task, though other languages (.NET, C++) are listed as options</span></div>
        <div class="arrow">↓</div>
        <div class="stage"><span class="name">3 · Behavioral + Cognitive</span><span class="dur">40 min — personality; gamified/immersive puzzles &amp; numerical equations</span></div>
        <div class="arrow">↓</div>
        <div class="stage"><span class="name">4 · Communication</span><span class="dur">~25–30 min, separate slot — automated reading/listening/speaking/writing</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="note">Your invite lists this order (Technical → Coding → Behavioral+Cognitive → Communication). A few 2025–26 candidate reports describe Behavioral+Cognitive running <em>before</em> the Technical MCQs instead — order seems to vary by drive/college. It doesn't change what to study, only the sequence on the day, so don't be thrown if your screen order differs slightly from this list.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="block">
      <div class="block-title"><div class="badge">R</div><h3>Research guardrail — what is confirmed vs variable</h3></div>
      <div class="block-meta">Research snapshot: 24 Sept 2026 · your invitation remains the source of truth</div>
      <div class="evidence-grid">
        <div class="evidence-card ev-confirmed"><div class="ev-title">CONFIRMED · Your assessment</div><div class="ev-body">Use the structure and timings in your invite first: Technical → Coding → Behavioral + Cognitive → Communication, with the listed technical domains.</div></div>
        <div class="evidence-card ev-reported"><div class="ev-title">REPEATED · Recent 2025–26 reports</div><div class="ev-body">Common recent coding shape: one DSA/backend problem + one SQL task + one HTML/CSS/JS task. Technical reports repeatedly mention pseudocode, Office, networking/security/cloud, and sometimes OS/DBMS basics.</div></div>
        <div class="evidence-card ev-variant"><div class="ev-title">VARIABLE · Do not memorize</div><div class="ev-body">Exact cognitive games, coding difficulty, question count, languages, and elimination rules vary by drive. Train the underlying skill, not a predicted paper.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="source-strip"><strong>Planning rule:</strong> official/invite evidence controls the core syllabus; recent candidate evidence only fills gaps or adds a small contingency buffer. No syllabus expansion from a single anecdote.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="block">
      <div class="block-title"><div class="badge amber">02</div><h3>Your priority split across the four rounds</h3></div>
      <div class="block-meta">Same order every day — if a day runs short, cut from the bottom, never the top. Behavioral needs 30 minutes or less; don't over-invest there.</div>
      <div class="priority-bars">
        <div class="pbar-row"><div class="pbar-top"><span class="pname">Programming fundamentals + Pseudocode</span><span class="pval">22%</span></div><div class="pbar-track"><div class="pbar-fill" style="width:88%"></div></div></div>
        <div class="pbar-row"><div class="pbar-top"><span class="pname">DSA + Coding patterns (Java)</span><span class="pval">25%</span></div><div class="pbar-track"><div class="pbar-fill" style="width:100%"></div></div></div>
        <div class="pbar-row"><div class="pbar-top"><span class="pname">Networking</span><span class="pval">12%</span></div><div class="pbar-track"><div class="pbar-fill" style="width:48%"></div></div></div>
        <div class="pbar-row"><div class="pbar-top"><span class="pname">Security</span><span class="pval">8%</span></div><div class="pbar-track"><div class="pbar-fill" style="width:32%"></div></div></div>
        <div class="pbar-row"><div class="pbar-top"><span class="pname">Cloud</span><span class="pval">7%</span></div><div class="pbar-track"><div class="pbar-fill" style="width:28%"></div></div></div>
        <div class="pbar-row"><div class="pbar-top"><span class="pname">SQL (backup coding language)</span><span class="pval">6%</span></div><div class="pbar-track"><div class="pbar-fill" style="width:24%"></div></div></div>
        <div class="pbar-row"><div class="pbar-top"><span class="pname">Cognitive (puzzles + numerical)</span><span class="pval">7%</span></div><div class="pbar-track"><div class="pbar-fill" style="width:28%"></div></div></div>
        <div class="pbar-row"><div class="pbar-top"><span class="pname">Communication</span><span class="pval">6%</span></div><div class="pbar-track"><div class="pbar-fill" style="width:24%"></div></div></div>
        <div class="pbar-row"><div class="pbar-top"><span class="pname">MS Office / common apps</span><span class="pval">5%</span></div><div class="pbar-track"><div class="pbar-fill" style="width:20%"></div></div></div>
        <div class="pbar-row"><div class="pbar-top"><span class="pname">Behavioral (personality)</span><span class="pval">2%</span></div><div class="pbar-track"><div class="pbar-fill" style="width:8%"></div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="block">
      <div class="block-title"><div class="badge red">03</div><h3>Pick your coding language now</h3></div>
      <div class="block-meta">One decision, made once — don't revisit it under time pressure on the day</div>
