      <div class="block-title"><div class="badge amber">HM</div><h3>Hashing — highest payoff for this format</h3></div>
      <div class="subgroup-label">Structures &amp; patterns</div>
      <ul class="checklist" data-group="day2">
        <li><span class="tri" data-id="d2-8"></span><label for="d2-8">HashMap / HashSet core operations</label></li>
        <li><span class="tri" data-id="d2-9"></span><label for="d2-9">Frequency counting, duplicate detection</label></li>
