      <ul class="checklist" data-group="day2">
        <li><span class="tri" data-id="d2-12"></span><label for="d2-12">Linear vs binary search — sorted-array requirement, boundaries</label></li>
        <li><span class="tri" data-id="d2-13"></span><label for="d2-13">Bubble / selection / insertion sort — behavior + complexity</label></li>
        <li><span class="tri" data-id="d2-14"></span><label for="d2-14">Merge / quick sort — concept + complexity only</label></li>
      </ul>
