      <ul class="checklist" data-group="day2">
        <li><span class="tri" data-id="d2-15"></span><label for="d2-15">Opposite &amp; same-direction two pointers on sorted arrays</label></li>
        <li><span class="tri" data-id="d2-16"></span><label for="d2-16">Fixed-size sliding window, basic variable-size window — a Dec-2025 2026-batch report named a <b>dynamic (variable-size) sliding-window</b> problem specifically as the DSA question, so don't treat fixed-size as the only variant</label></li>
      </ul>
      <div class="subgroup-label">Stack, queue, linked list &amp; matrix</div>
      <ul class="checklist" data-group="day2">
        <li><span class="tri" data-id="d2-17"></span><label for="d2-17">Stack — push/pop/peek, parentheses problems</label></li>
        <li><span class="tri" data-id="d2-18"></span><label for="d2-18">Queue — FIFO, basic BFS idea</label></li>
        <li><span class="tri" data-id="d2-19"></span><label for="d2-19">Linked list traversal / reversal, fast &amp; slow pointers (cycle detection, finding the middle node)</label></li>
        <li><span class="tri" data-id="d2-20"></span><label for="d2-20">Matrix traversal (rows/cols/diagonals)</label></li>
      </ul>
      <div class="subgroup-label">Basic math patterns — easy "warm-up" questions, don't skip these</div>
      <ul class="checklist" data-group="day2">
        <li><span class="tri" data-id="d2-29"></span><label for="d2-29">Prime check, GCD/LCM (Euclidean algorithm)</label></li>
        <li><span class="tri" data-id="d2-30"></span><label for="d2-30">Factorial, Fibonacci series (iterative + recursive)</label></li>
        <li><span class="tri" data-id="d2-31"></span><label for="d2-31">Digit sum, digit/number reversal, palindrome numbers, Armstrong numbers</label></li>
      </ul>
