      <div class="block-title"><div class="badge">SQ</div><h3>SQL — reported as one of the 3 coding questions, not just a backup</h3></div>
      <div class="subgroup-label">Query basics</div>
      <ul class="checklist" data-group="day2">
        <li><span class="tri" data-id="d2-21"></span><label for="d2-21">SELECT / WHERE / ORDER BY / DISTINCT</label></li>
      </ul>
      <div class="subgroup-label">Aggregation &amp; joins</div>
      <ul class="checklist" data-group="day2">
        <li><span class="tri" data-id="d2-22"></span><label for="d2-22">COUNT, SUM, AVG, MIN, MAX + GROUP BY / HAVING</label></li>
        <li><span class="tri" data-id="d2-23"></span><label for="d2-23">INNER / LEFT / RIGHT JOIN, primary vs foreign key — reports specifically describe a join-based query against a given schema</label></li>
