      <ul class="checklist" data-group="day2">
        <li><span class="tri" data-id="d2-24"></span><label for="d2-24">Subqueries with IN / EXISTS</label></li>
        <li><span class="tri" data-id="d2-25"></span><label for="d2-25">WHERE vs HAVING, WHERE vs ON, COUNT(*) vs COUNT(column)</label></li>
