    <div class="day-head"><h2>Round 4 — Communication Assessment</h2><span class="day-date">~25–30 min · separate slot, reached after clearing Round 3</span></div>
    <p class="day-objective">Software-graded verbal + written test. Reached last, and usually scheduled as its own separate slot rather than the same sitting as the rest.</p>
    <div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill" id="prog-day4"></div></div>
    <div class="tri-legend">
      <span class="lg"><span class="dot" style="background:var(--red)"></span>Fix now</span>
